    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "CENTER",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Flip had been trading fake Heart Pieces as a scam. Using candy pieces, he completed his own heart."
    },
    {
      "char": "flipturner",
      "pos": "LEFT",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "dextra",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "nistro",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Flip brought his completed Heart to Nistro and Dextra, who were running the tournament and enforcing the rules."
    },
    {
      "char": "flipturner",
      "pos": "CENTER",
      "image": "",
      "text": "I got my pieces! All five of 'em, look!"
    },
    {
      "char": "nistro",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "flipturner",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "My Heart Piece is complete!"
    },
    {
      "char": "nistro",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "discouragement",
      "text": "My! That’s impressive! It didn’t take you very long."
    },
    {
      "char": "flipturner",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": "Am I the first duelist to make the finals then? Amazing!"
    },
    {
      "char": "nistro",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Unless that's made out of candy."
    },
    {
      "char": "flipturner",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "shy",
      "text": "W-W-What?"
    },
    {
      "char": "flipturner",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Are you suggesting that this Heart Piece could be a fake?"
    },
    {
      "char": "flipturner",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "I would never pull a trick like that, sir!"
    },
    {
      "char": "nistro",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "Prove it isn't candy by tasting it then!"
    },
    {
      "char": "flipturner",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "discouragement",
      "text": "Okay..."
    },
    {
      "char": "flipturner",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "This... tastes good..."
    },
    {
      "char": "flipturner",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "And... Oh my! It's melting!"
    },
    {
      "char": "flipturner",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "Unbelievable! Someone swapped my Heart Piece with scrumptious candy! What dastardly sweet-toothed villain would do such a thing?"
    },
    {
      "char": "nistro",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Knock it off, kid! I caught ya!"
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "LEFT",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "Flip!"
    },
    {
      "char": "flipturner",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "Yuma, help!"
    },
    {
      "char": "flipturner",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "What are you planning to do with Flip?"
    },
    {
      "char": "dextra",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "dextra",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "This cheat made fake Heart Pieces."
    },
    {
      "char": "dextra",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "He's banned from competing in this and all future Duel Carnivals."
    },
    {
      "char": "dextra",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "Plus I'm kicking him out of Heartland City!"
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "Flip was wrong, but isn't this a little extreme?"
    },
    {
      "char": "dextra",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "I'll tell you what's extreme. He violated our sacred rules of conduct!"
    },
    {
      "char": "dextra",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Now he'll suffer the consequences!"
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "sad",
      "text": "I can't deny that Flip made a huge mistake and deserves to be punished."
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "But you can't just ban him forever!"
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "How about we settle this honorably with a duel?"
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "If I beat you, then you'll agree to give him a second chance."
    },
    {
      "char": "dextra",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "Fine then, you'll duel me. If you win, your friend gets his second chance. But if you lose, you get the exact same punishment as him."
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Let's duel!"
    }
  ]
}
